    <string name="voting_confirm_launch_held">Launch “%1$s”? It holds its owner deposit already (%2$s): nothing more is sent. Then its committee is drawn and the secret voting starts.</string>
    <string name="voting_confirm_launch">Launch “%1$s”? It sends %2$s to the voting: the owner deposit and the rewards fund. Then its committee is drawn and the secret voting starts.</string>
    <string name="voting_confirm_launch_less">Launch “%1$s”? It sends %2$s to the voting: the owner deposit and the rewards fund, less the %3$s it holds. Then its committee is drawn and the secret voting starts.</string>
    <string name="voting_confirm_prolong">Prolong “%1$s”? The contract draws a new committee for it.</string>
    <string name="voting_confirm_finish">Finish “%1$s” and pay out? The contract counts the votes and pays the oracles who voted for the result (all who voted, when no option wins), sends the owner\'s share (the deposit back and the owner fee) to %2$s, and burns what is left.</string>
    <string name="voting_confirm_terminate_pending">Terminate “%1$s”? It never started: the contract sends the %2$s it holds to you, and half of its stake back to its author (the other half is burned).</string>
    <string name="voting_confirm_terminate_empty">Terminate “%1$s”? The contract removes it and sends half of its stake back to its author (the other half is burned).</string>
    <string name="voting_confirm_terminate">Terminate “%1$s”? The contract closes it: the owner\'s share (the deposit back and the owner fee) goes to %2$s, the rest of its %3$s to the oracles who voted (to you, when nobody voted), and half of its stake back to its author (the other half is burned).</string>
    <string name="voting_confirm_add_funds">Send %1$s to “%2$s”? It joins the voting\'s funds, paid out by its rules; it cannot be taken back.\n\nFee: about %3$s iDNA.</string>
